>The former. Sacrificing will *always* give some sort of indicative
>message if you can't safely pray.

  Yes.  No message, "feeling of reconciliation", and a clover all mean
safe to pray.  Crowning or a divine gift mean it was safe to pray, but
is no longer safe to pray.

